# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=seatd
pkgver=0.9.1
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="libseat: lets a compositor use the screen and input devices of the seat it runs on"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://git.sr.ht/~kennylevinsen/seatd"
license=(MIT)
depends=(glibc systemd)
source=("seatd-$pkgver.tar.gz::https://git.sr.ht/~kennylevinsen/seatd/archive/$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('PIN')

build() {
    # through systemd-logind (the session a console login gets), or seatd
    meson setup seatd-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release \
        -D libseat-logind=systemd -D libseat-builtin=enabled -D server=enabled \
        -D examples=disabled -D man-pages=disabled
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
